  "scope": "Roles added after the reviewed opening catalog: linked exterior field scene bindings (capability 2), House present objects (capability 3) and Mick wander, reviewed woof trees and mick_bark (capability 4). Kept apart from native-resource-catalog.json so the reviewed opening room provenance does not depend on later scenes or objects; merged into the same data/native.encresources. Capability 6 adds independent source NPC motion owners, with no borrowed Mick dialogue. Initial Mayor Office scene, stationary source NPCs, reviewed initial help choices, music and run-sound areas; later rescue/zoo branches fail closed. Capability 12 publishes the complete independently checked persistent player action, compact graphics, audio binding and graph group; executable input/GPU integration is separately verified. Capability13 adds independent scene FieldObjects49/1032 for source ready, checked drawing and deletion; manual pickup remains unavailable.",
